", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nW0oooooo/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1e52f4c0/uploads/origins/6fff5134-34ac-41f6-ab84-d5fcc019fb29?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8ebc4d1f840757ab9d22c49e4d8ebcc4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1e52f4c0/uploads/origins/6fff5134-34ac-41f6-ab84-d5fcc019fb29?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8ebc4d1f840757ab9d22c49e4d8ebcc4, https://si.imgix.net/1e52f4c0/uploads/origins/6fff5134-34ac-41f6-ab84-d5fcc019fb29?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6e97cc1cc17364a807eb31ccfce4bd91 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1e52f4c0/uploads/origins/6fff5134-34ac-41f6-ab84-d5fcc019fb29?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2434bf30540ea80ec6e43ad4d666c986 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ﾝｦさんイメージのオシャレカジュアルネクタルが見たいです。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nW0oooooo/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/11fcec8c/uploads/origins/a1e483be-c4e6-4bb9-9ede-c7c78fdf6539?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=620fe3a6d993e921b3cc816af634cf18", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/11fcec8c/uploads/origins/a1e483be-c4e6-4bb9-9ede-c7c78fdf6539?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=620fe3a6d993e921b3cc816af634cf18, https://si.imgix.net/11fcec8c/uploads/origins/a1e483be-c4e6-4bb9-9ede-c7c78fdf6539?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=22bfa1c86265a2ea43a2607781a92481 2x, https://si.imgix.net/11fcec8c/uploads/origins/a1e483be-c4e6-4bb9-9ede-c7c78fdf6539?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5a6bff8f767fe06c9cd0ca73cf3f0577 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "https://skeb.jp/@Kentaidaki/works/2\nこの人間で\nhttps://img.gamewith.jp/img/75f441d9e4ae421f7324281d75ae0731.png\nおおまかにこんな感じの黒い